    "homepage": "https://wordpress.org/themes/prime-cleaning-services/",
    "sections": {
        "description": "The Prime Cleaning Services Theme is a modern, SEO-optimized, and fully responsive design tailored for residential, commercial, and industrial cleaning businesses of all sizes. Ideal for home cleaning, office cleaning, eco-friendly services, housekeeping agencies, carpet and upholstery cleaning, window washing, deep cleaning, post-construction cleanup, move-in/move-out cleaning, pressure washing, bathroom and kitchen sanitation, janitorial services, floor polishing, tile and grout cleaning, exterior maintenance, roof and gutter cleaning, hotel and restaurant cleaning, daycare cleaning, warehouse sanitation, hospital cleaning, and retail cleaning, this theme helps showcase every service professionally. Its clean and engaging layout includes customizable sections for pricing plans, team profiles, testimonials, service highlights, and before–after galleries to build credibility and attract clients. Fully integrated with plugins like Contact Form 7 for inquiries, Bookly for appointment booking, and WooCommerce for service-based payments, it offers end-to-end functionality for managing client interactions. Built with lightweight, optimized code, it ensures fast loading, mobile responsiveness, and cross-browser compatibility. The Prime Cleaning Services theme also supports social media integration and popular SEO plugins like Rank Math and Yoast SEO to enhance search visibility and local ranking. Its intuitive customization options allow businesses to modify layouts, fonts, and color palettes to align with their branding while offering a user-friendly experience across all devices. Whether you’re running a small home cleaning agency, a commercial janitorial service, or a large-scale maintenance company, this theme provides the perfect platform to boost your online presence, streamline bookings, and grow your cleaning business efficiently."
    },
